      "order": 4,
      "depth": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "content": "Details of Kshethram: \nMoolavar: Narasimha Perumal\nThayaar: Parimalavalli Nachiyar\nVimanam: Govardhana Vimanam\nPushkarani: Indra Theertham\n\nTravel: This kshethram is located in Joshimath en route to Badrinath in Uttarakhand.\n\nAzhwar Pasuram:\nTirumangai Azhwar: 10 Pasurams",
      "textFontSizeHint": 16
